# Drive group on the Google and Microsoft account pages. Never press Install, Connect, Mount or Disconnect.
ipc panels settings google
wait 2
ptr move 1100 600 sleep 200 scroll 0 30
wait 1
shot drive-google
note D1 title, row label/detail, buttons and footer of the Drive group match QML for the same state (sandbox: probably not connected).
ipc panels settings microsoft
wait 2
ptr move 1100 600 sleep 200 scroll 0 30
wait 1
shot drive-ms
note D1 Microsoft Drive group: same title, rows, buttons and footer as QML.
# MANUAL: D2 if connected and mounted, click Open: the folder opens in Files; close it (needs a real account)
ipc panels close
